      "h1": "Globalize Offices and Branches",
      "shortAnswer": "Globalize’s current branch page lists a Giza head office and offices in Dokki, Haram, and Salah Salem/Heliopolis. The addresses and displayed hours are shown below. Check each map link and current operating status before travelling; the list does not establish service-area or service-by-branch availability.",
      "body": "## Listed locations\n\n| Office | Address shown on Globalize’s live page, checked 26 September 2026 | Map / visit note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Giza head office | 1 Cairo University St., Office 29, 8th Floor, above Omar Effendi, Giza, Egypt. | [Open map](https://maps.google.com/?q=1+Cairo+University+St%2C+Giza%2C+Egypt+Globalize+Group); recheck before visiting. |\n| Dokki, Giza | 2B Okasha St., 5th Floor, next to Real Estate Registry Office, Dokki, Giza, Egypt. | [Open map](https://maps.google.com/?q=2B+Okasha+St%2C+Dokki%2C+Giza%2C+Egypt+Globalize+Group); recheck before visiting. |\n| Haram, Giza | 6 Ayoub St., off Haram St., next to Cairo Mall, Haram, Giza, Egypt. | [Open map](https://maps.google.com/?q=6+Ayoub+St%2C+Haram%2C+Giza%2C+Egypt+Globalize+Group); recheck before visiting. |\n| Salah Salem, Heliopolis | Building 31, Office 4, Al-Obour Buildings, Salah Salem St., Heliopolis, Cairo, Egypt. | [Open map](https://maps.google.com/?q=Building+31+Al-Obour+Buildings%2C+Salah+Salem+St%2C+Cairo%2C+Egypt+Globalize+Group); recheck before visiting. |\n\nThe general hours currently recorded for Globalize are Saturday–Thursday, 9:00 a.m.–9:00 p.m. Branch-specific hours, holiday exceptions, appointment requirements, and temporary closures are not separately confirmed here; verify before travelling.\n\n## Contact Globalize before visiting\n\nPhone/WhatsApp: `+20 106 299 0808`  \nEmail: `info@globalizetl.com`\n\nAsk which office is appropriate for your purpose, whether an appointment or particular document-handling arrangement is required, and whether the branch is currently open. Do not assume that every service is available at every location or that a branch provides walk-in, pickup, courier, interpretation, or localization support.\n\n## Location is not geographic coverage\n\nThe listed offices identify physical locations only. They do not establish nationwide coverage, remote-service eligibility, on-site availability, delivery areas, or availability of a named translation service at each branch. Use the relevant service page for service scope and confirm any location-specific arrangements directly.",
